<title>FRANCE: French court delays TF1, Canal Plus decision.</title>
<headline>French court delays TF1, Canal Plus decision.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Paris commercial court on Tuesday said that it would render its decision on a dispute between TF1 and Canal Plus on November 19.</p>
<p>The decision had been expected today.</p>
<p>TF1 is seeking to stop a planned merger between Canal Plus and Nethold because it says the deal goes against previously agreed contracts about sports broadcasts on Eurosport, in which TF1 and Canal Plus both hold stakes.</p>
</text>
